    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Wearing",
     "texto": [
      "«Wearing» is **indossare**: **Indosso una giacca** (I'm wearing a jacket). **Portare** is also used.",
      "Colours agree with the item of clothing: **un cappotto nero**, **una giacca nera**, **le scarpe nere**. Remember that **blu** never changes.",
      "To choose: **Mi piace questo** (I like this one), **Preferisco quello** (I prefer that one)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
